{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜藤嶌果歩(19)です🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近マットレスと枕を変えました！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人気のものをゲットしてみたら今日はぐっすり眠れすぎて中々ベッドから起き上がれませんでした"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寝具のおかげか私のポテンシャルかは分かりませんが、、"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobnswT2Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobc3ZCzg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちもち🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.tiktok.com/@kahorin_1st/video/7652335612569111828"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちクラ動画が写真集の公式TikTokに載っています！ぜひTikTokもチェックしてね♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなあいでは発足ならずでしたが、もちもちたちを集めて一緒にもちクラ活動するのはわたしの夢です💤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日ももちもち頑張ります〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobaDi0M4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちもちクラブはあなたの心の中で生き続けるでしょう。。💛"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobfTrbiO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobDXoQ2D.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Cookie makeしてみた❕🍪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪色がクッキーっぽい色になったから似合うかなって思ってやってみたの！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "インスタにリール載せたから見てみてね！🤎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(クッキーメイクとはクッキーっぽい色味のメイクの事である)"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobtuF3YS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京カレンダーさんに登場しています🗼🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "憧れの東カレさん！✨✨"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おいしい焼き鳥を頂いて特別な1日を過ごしました！大人っぽいスタイリングにドキドキです😌"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobibJWsr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/moblG0CYA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mob4OIQOH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵なオフショットたちでした〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえばきらちゃんが昨日焼き鳥屋さんの話してて食べたくなった！おいしいお店知りたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はスパイダーマンを初めて見ています"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今2見終わった！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ書き終わったら3みるよー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見たことある方は推しシーズン教えてね🪄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "月曜日もお疲れさまです🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩"}], "source": "official"}